== Trivia ==
* In ''Antibirth'', fully constructing The Knife required 3 Knife Pieces, with the third appearing in Mausoleum II. For Repentance, however, the third piece was removed, and the completed knife only requires the player to obtain two pieces from Downpour and Mines.
** Also in ''Antibirth,'' there was a mechanic where somewhere on the floor, there was a special [[Teleporters|Teleporter]] that usually required solving a puzzle, having flight, or using pickups to access. This [[Teleporters|Teleporter]] led to a second section of the floor, a cluster of rooms with enemies and a few random special rooms. Since this second area was on the same map as the main part of the floor, it could also be accessed by using the {{i|Red Key}} enough times to reach it, or by teleporting to it with other means. Both floors of the Mausoleum had this feature, and in Mausoleum II it was required to go there to solve a puzzle in order to unlock Knife Piece 3. However, like Knife Piece 3, this mechanic was also removed in Repentance.
* {{e|The Visage}} was originally a Mausoleum boss in ''Antibirth'', but it was changed in Repentance to appear on Mausoleum's alternate floor, Gehenna. Its appearance was also updated from grey and purple to black and red to reflect this.
** This might have been because of Gehenna's "torture chamber" theming, which The Visage complements more so than Mausoleum's occult theming.
* Mausoleum is referred to on [[Isaac's last will|Isaac's Last Will]] as "Some Cursed Place".

